  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1 / (6 - 5)) + (1 / (5 - 4)) + (1 / (4 - 3)) - 3 =?\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nEvaluate individual terms.\n\nSum up terms.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (1 / (6 - 5)) = 1 / 1 = 1\n\n⇒ (1 / (5 - 4)) = 1 / 1 = 1\n\n⇒ (1 / (4 - 3)) = 1 / 1 = 1\n\n⇒ 1 + 1 + 1 - 3 = 3 - 3 = 0\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 0.**",
